## 💰 Daily & Monthly Cost by Model

| Model | Input Rate | Output Rate | **Daily Cost** | **Monthly Cost (30d)** |
|-------|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| **Claude Haiku 4.5** ⭐ | $1.00/MTok | $5.00/MTok | **$0.50** | **$15.00** |
| **Claude Sonnet 4.6** | $3.00/MTok | $15.00/MTok | **$1.50** | **$45.00** |
| **Claude Opus 4.6** | $5.00/MTok | $25.00/MTok | **$2.50** | **$75.00** |

> [!TIP]
> **With Prompt Caching** (system prompts are identical every call), you can reduce input costs by **up to 90%** on cached tokens. This would bring Haiku down to **~$0.15/day** and Sonnet to **~$0.55/day**.

